Package: mystiquectl
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-usb, usbutils
Description: Linux control utility for the DeepCool MYSTIQUE 360 LCD AIO cooler
 mystiquectl repacks DeepCool's own official MYSTIQUE Electron control
 application (extracted locally by the user from DeepCool's own Windows
 installer) so it runs natively on Linux, backed by real Linux sensor
 telemetry and a small USB bridge to the physical cooler
 (vendor:product 3633:0009).
 .
 This package does not include DeepCool's app.asar or the Electron
 runtime; both must be fetched/extracted separately after installation
 (run `mystiquectl update`, or see the project's install.sh), since
 DeepCool's own application bundle is proprietary and is never
 redistributed by this project.
 .
 This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by DeepCool.
